# Copy to .dev.vars for local development. Never commit .dev.vars.
PAY_TO_ADDRESS=0xYourBaseWalletAddress
CDP_API_KEY_ID=your-cdp-api-key-id
CDP_API_KEY_SECRET=your-cdp-api-key-secret
# 64 hex chars — generate with: npm run keys:generate
SIGNING_KEY=replace-with-64-hex-char-ed25519-seed
ADMIN_PASSWORD=pick-something-the-keeper-can-remember
# Optional. Glama's connector ownership claim token (glama_claim_...),
# served at /.well-known/glama.json. Unset, that path 404s.
GLAMA_CLAIM=
# Optional. The Web Bot Auth EGRESS key: a second 64-hex ed25519 seed,
# never the same value as SIGNING_KEY. Signs the Worker's outbound
# probes and publishes /.well-known/http-message-signatures-directory;
# unset, egress is unsigned and that path 404s. It must be the seed the
# live directory already lists — `npm run keys:check:wba` tells you
# whether a candidate is that seed. A different one is a rotation.
WBA_SIGNING_KEY=
# Optional. The field wallet's secp256k1 private key — the buyer-side
# wallet the Launch Check pays FROM (PAY_TO_ADDRESS receives; this
# spends). Must be listed in src/store/house-wallets.json first. Unset,
# the launch_check door refuses new purchases before any money moves.
FIELD_WALLET_KEY=
# Optional. Ownership proof(s) for this origin: whitespace- or
# comma-separated signatures, each one a signature over THE BARE ORIGIN
# STRING (https://scvd.store — no trailing slash, no path) by one of the
# payTo addresses the accepts name. Published at the root of
# /openapi.json as x-agentcash-provenance.ownershipProofs, where
# x402scan, mppscan and AgentCash read it; a match moves the origin from
# origin_hosted to ownership_verified. Unset, the extension is absent and
# the origin is simply unproved. Sign with the PAY_TO wallet, e.g.
#   cast wallet sign --private-key $KEY "https://scvd.store"
# and paste only the signature — the private key never belongs here.
# Verify what is deployed with: npm run ownership:check
ORIGIN_OWNERSHIP_PROOFS=

# NOTE: this file feeds `wrangler dev` — the Worker, locally. The
# walkabout runner (scripts/walkabout.mjs) is a separate Node process
# and reads its own environment; it does not read .dev.vars. See
# WALKABOUT.md, "Where the run's secrets live, and where they do not".
